      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING ARVADA (8) has a strong record this trip with nine wins and eight placings from 24 starts. Scored by 2.5 lengths last time (21.88) in a Grade 4/5 over 390m at Warrnambool. Expected to be in the finish. FLYING INTENTION (1) comes off a (23.43) win last time, scoring by a nose in a Grade 4/5 over 410m at Horsham. Has already won two times from this draw. Can hit the frame with the right run. DOONGALLA MIMIC (6) struggled to get involved last start after being shuffled back early at The Meadows, but prior to that won by one length at Horsham (23.38) beating Dave in a Grade 5 on June 2. Won at his only start from this box. Bold showing expected. KRAKEN TOMMY (3) is going well, finishing in the placings twice in a row. Not beaten far last time when a neck second (25.38) in a Grade 5 at Shepparton.",
